# ── Cloudflare Secrets (Production) ────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# API keys are stored as Cloudflare secrets — NOT in a .env file.
# Set them via the Cloudflare dashboard or the Wrangler CLI:
#
#   wrangler secret put OPENAI_API_KEY
#   wrangler secret put ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
#   wrangler secret put GEMINI_API_KEY
#   wrangler secret put DEEPSEEK_API_KEY
#
# Or: Cloudflare Dashboard → Workers & Pages → your project
#     → Settings → Environment Variables → Secrets

# ── Local Development ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# For local dev with `npm run dev` (wrangler pages dev), create a file
# named .dev.vars in the project root (it is gitignored). Wrangler reads
# it automatically — same format as .env:
#
#   OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
#   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
#   GEMINI_API_KEY=AIza...
#   DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-...
#
# ── Required Keys ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#   OPENAI_API_KEY      → https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
#   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY   → https://console.anthropic.com/
#   GEMINI_API_KEY      → https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#   DEEPSEEK_API_KEY    → https://platform.deepseek.com/api_keys  (used as the impartial judge)
#
# ── Optional Model Overrides ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#   OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o           (default: gpt-4o)
#   CLAUDE_MODEL=claude-opus-4-5  (default: claude-opus-4-5)
#   GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-1.5-pro   (default: gemini-1.5-pro)
